  "name": "Celebrations Collector Chest",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "A tin for the Pokémon 25th anniversary, sold on its own from 22 October 2021 after first coming inside the Celebrations Prime Collection. It held three remixed promos with the 25th Anniversary logo, each bringing back an old card type: Mimikyu δ as Delta Species, last seen in POP Series 5, Light Toxtricity as a Light Pokémon, last seen in Neo Destiny, and Hydreigon C as a Pokémon SP, last seen in Arceus. It also held six Celebrations and two other booster packs, sticker sheets, a notepad, a coin and a mini portfolio.",
